The executed verifier completed with PASS and reproduced both the known
nu<=5 census and the new nu<=6 extension. Its local source SHA-256 was

    d8c892f7b2c8425bca94f9a6df0e782e3fbd8c23fe421a2f101f2b7f8f32a01c.

The exact counts above are computational proof of the finite support
